1
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:21,000
In the Name of the King III is a action, adventure,
drama film directed by Uwe Boll.

2
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:36,000
Hazen Kaine, an American contract killer living in Sofia, Bulgaria, gets more
than he bargains for when he enters into a contract with the mob.

3
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:51,000
One last job before he gets out and starts a new life for himself.

4
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
The targets: the three children of royal billionaire Andon Dupont.

5
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Seems simple enough, or so he thought.

6
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:36,000
Hazen apprehends the children, and before he can blink an eye, a simple necklace worn
by one of the children sends his life spiraling back to medieval times.

7
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:51,000
Now completely out of his element, Hazen fights for his life as he tries to
escape a medieval army and a fierce fire-breathing dragon.

8
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,000
Hazen Kaine, played by Dominic Purcell.

9
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:21,000
Arabella, played by Ralitsa Paskaleva.

10
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
Emeline, played by Daria Simeonova.

11
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:51,000
Sophie, played by Petra Gocheva.

12
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Alys, played by Marina Dakova.

13
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:21,000
Ulrich, played by Bashar Rahal.

14
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:36,000
In the Name of the King: A Dungeon Siege Tale (also known as Dungeon Siege: In the Name of the King or simply In the Name of the King) is a 2007 English-language fantasy action film
directed by Uwe Boll and starring Jason Statham, Claire Forlani, Leelee Sobieski, John Rhys-Davies, Ron Perlman, Ray Liotta and Burt Reynolds with Kristanna Loken.

15
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
It is inspired by the Dungeon Siege video game series, and was an international
co-production between Germany, Canada, and the United States.

16
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It premiered at the Brussels Festival of Fantastic Films on April 11,
2007, and was released in theatres on November 29, 2007.

17
01:12:15,000 --> 01:12:21,000
Upon its release, the film was a critical and commercial failure,
grossing only $13.1 million against a budget of $60 million.

18
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
The film explores themes of medallion, mercenary,
dragon, based on video game, sisters.

19
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
The tone is emotional.
